abstract: "Public school enrollment by grade, including prekindergarten and kindergarten, for the 50 US states and DC every fall from 2010 to 2022, with pre-K indicators and the share of 3- to 5-year-olds enrolled in school by state from 2021 to 2023, compiled from the NCES Digest of Education Statistics."
